:R-HSA-5099900  a           obo:GO_0008150 , owl:NamedIndividual ;
        rdfs:comment        "WNT5A induces internalization of FZD4 in a manner that depends upon PKC-mediated phosphorylation of DVL2. Uptake of FZD4 appears to occur in a clathrin, AP-2 and ARBB2-dependent mannner (Chen et al, 2003; Yu et al, 2007; Yu et al, 2010)." ;
